  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Employability and Entrepreneurship of Young People to Reduce the Risks of Irregular Migration - Youth, Employment and Migration (YEM 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides young people, including vulnerable groups such as women and people living with disabilities, with decent employment opportunities in order to reduce risks of irregular migration in Burkina Faso.</narrative>
  </description>
